<BRK/>
<NPR>6.  Identify type of sealant based on proposed use of pavements.  (See note in paragraph entitled "Joint Sealant.")</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<NPR>7.  For joint details see UFC 3-260-02, "Pavement Design for Airfields".</NPR><BRK/>
